   - The encoder needs to:
     a. Build header string: `BLUEPRINT:0,{layout},{5 icons},0,{ticks},{gameVersion},{urlEncodedShortDesc},{urlEncodedDesc}`
     b. Build binary content: 7×int32 header + uint8 areaCount + areas (14 bytes each) + int32 buildingCount + buildings (61+4*paramCount bytes each)
